    "custom_liquid_LxwRcf": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "Custom Liquid",
      "settings": {
        "full_width": true,
        "remove_vertical_spacing": false,
        "remove_horizontal_spacing": false,
        "liquid": "<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:ital,wght@0,600;0,700;1,900&display=swap\">\n\n<div class=\"gwa\">\n  <h2 class=\"gwa-title\">Ils l'ont adopté, et ils le disent mieux que nous</h2>\n\n  <!-- ⚠️ AVIS D'EXEMPLE — CONTENU FICTIF, NE PAS METTRE EN LIGNE TEL QUEL ⚠️ -->\n\n  <div class=\"gwa-grid\">\n\n    <article class=\"gwa-card\">\n      <img class=\"gwa-photo\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0980/1724/7556/files/ChatGPT_Image_21_sept._2026_21_06_40.png?v=1790018805\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <div class=\"gwa-panel\">\n        <div class=\"gwa-stars\" aria-label=\"5 sur 5\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n        </div>\n        <h3>«&nbsp;Mon argent sert à quelque chose&nbsp;»</h3>\n        <p>Je voulais juste un t-shirt, j'ai fini par soutenir un projet. Savoir où va l'argent, ça change complètement le rapport à l'achat.</p>\n        <div class=\"gwa-who\">\n          <img class=\"gwa-av\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0980/1724/7556/files/ChatGPT_Image_21_sept._2026_21_06_40.png?v=1790018805\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n          <div><strong>Mehdi</strong><em>42 ans · Nantes</em></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"gwa-card\">\n      <img class=\"gwa-photo\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0980/1724/7556/files/ChatGPT_Image_21_sept._2026_21_05_23.png?v=1790018804\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <div class=\"gwa-panel\">\n        <div class=\"gwa-stars\" aria-label=\"5 sur 5\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n        </div>\n        <h3>«&nbsp;J'achète, ils construisent&nbsp;»</h3>\n        <p>C'est la première fois que je commande un vêtement en sachant exactement ce qu'il finance. Je recommanderai à chaque collection.</p>\n        <div class=\"gwa-who\">\n          <img class=\"gwa-av\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0980/1724/7556/files/ChatGPT_Image_21_sept._2026_21_05_23.png?v=1790018804\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n          <div><strong>Sabrina</strong><em>39 ans · Toulouse</em></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"gwa-card\">\n      <img class=\"gwa-photo\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0980/1724/7556/files/ChatGPT_Image_21_sept._2026_21_16_49.png?v=1790018805\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <div class=\"gwa-panel\">\n        <div class=\"gwa-stars\" aria-label=\"5 sur 5\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n        </div>\n        <h3>«&nbsp;C'est ma ville que je porte&nbsp;»</h3>\n        <p>J'ai grandi là-bas, je n'y habite plus depuis quinze ans. Porter ce logo, c'est dire d'où je viens sans avoir à l'expliquer.</p>\n        <div class=\"gwa-who\">\n          <img class=\"gwa-av\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0980/1724/7556/files/ChatGPT_Image_21_sept._2026_21_16_49.png?v=1790018805\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n          <div><strong>ERIC</strong><em>48 ans · Bourges</em></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"gwa-card\">\n      <img class=\"gwa-photo\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0980/1724/7556/files/ChatGPT_Image_21_sept._2026_21_10_36.png?v=1790018804\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <div class=\"gwa-panel\">\n        <div class=\"gwa-stars\" aria-label=\"5 sur 5\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n        </div>\n        <h3>«&nbsp;On se reconnaît dans la rue&nbsp;»</h3>\n        <p>J'ai croisé quelqu'un avec le même à la gare Saint-Charles. On s'est fait un signe sans se connaître, à 800 kilomètres de Grigny. C'est exactement ce que la marque fabrique.</p>\n        <div class=\"gwa-who\">\n          <img class=\"gwa-av\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0980/1724/7556/files/ChatGPT_Image_21_sept._2026_21_10_36.png?v=1790018804\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n          <div><strong>Fatou</strong><em>36 ans · Marseille</em></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"gwa-card\">\n      <img class=\"gwa-photo\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0980/1724/7556/files/ChatGPT_Image_21_sept._2026_21_19_58.png?v=1790018804\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <div class=\"gwa-panel\">\n        <div class=\"gwa-stars\" aria-label=\"5 sur 5\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n        </div>\n        <h3>«&nbsp;Le 350 g, ça se sent tout de suite&nbsp;»</h3>\n        <p>Rien à voir avec les tee-shirts fins que j'avais avant. Il a du corps, il tombe bien, et il n'a pas bougé après une dizaine de lavages.</p>\n        <div class=\"gwa-who\">\n          <img class=\"gwa-av\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0980/1724/7556/files/ChatGPT_Image_21_sept._2026_21_19_58.png?v=1790018804\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n          <div><strong>Thomas</strong><em>51 ans · Brest</em></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"gwa-card\">\n      <img class=\"gwa-photo\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0980/1724/7556/files/ChatGPT_Image_21_sept._2026_21_22_13.png?v=1790018804\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <div class=\"gwa-panel\">\n        <div class=\"gwa-stars\" aria-label=\"5 sur 5\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n        </div>\n        <h3>«&nbsp;Je ne suis pas de Grigny, et alors&nbsp;?&nbsp;»</h3>\n        <p>J'ai hésité en me disant que c'était réservé à ceux du coin. En fait pas du tout : c'est une fierté qui parle à tout le monde.</p>\n        <div class=\"gwa-who\">\n          <img class=\"gwa-av\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0980/1724/7556/files/ChatGPT_Image_21_sept._2026_21_22_13.png?v=1790018804\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n          <div><strong>Camille</strong><em>44 ans · Carcassonne</em></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n.gwa{\n  /* ================= RÉGLAGES ================= */\n  --gw-ink:#111111;\n  --gw-bg:#FFFFFF;\n  --gw-card-bg:#FFFFFF;\n  --gw-photo-bg:#EEEEEE;\n\n  --gw-frame:#111111;\n  --gw-frame-w:1.5px;\n  --gw-radius:14px;\n\n  --gw-neon:#F7A81B;\n  --gw-neon-rgb:247,168,27;\n  --gw-halo-0:.45;\n  --gw-halo-1:.50;\n  --gw-halo-2:.32;\n  --gw-halo-3:.18;\n\n  --gw-max:1760px;\n\n  /* ---- MOBILE ---- */\n  --gw-card-w:74vw;        /* largeur de carte : baisser = carte plus petite */\n  --gw-photo-ar:2/3;       /* ratio des photos : 2/3 = aucun rognage */\n  --gw-photo-pos:center center;\n  /* ============================================ */\n\n  background:var(--gw-bg);\n  color:var(--gw-ink);\n  padding:60px 24px 68px;\n  box-sizing:border-box;\n  font-family:'Archivo',system-ui,sans-serif;\n}\n.gwa *{box-sizing:border-box;}\n\n.gwa-title{\n  font-family:'Archivo',system-ui,sans-serif;\n  font-weight:900;font-style:italic;text-transform:uppercase;\n  text-align:center;color:var(--gw-ink);\n  font-size:clamp(22px,3.4vw,38px);\n  line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-0.015em;\n  text-wrap:balance;\n  margin:0 0 46px;\n}\n\n.gwa-grid{\n  display:grid;\n  grid-template-columns:1fr;\n  gap:26px;\n  max-width:var(--gw-max);\n  margin:0 auto;\n}\n\n.gwa-card{\n  display:flex;\n  height:100%;\n  background:var(--gw-card-bg);\n  border:var(--gw-frame-w) solid var(--gw-frame);\n  border-radius:var(--gw-radius);\n  overflow:hidden;\n  box-shadow:\n    0 0 0 1px rgba(var(--gw-neon-rgb),var(--gw-halo-0)),\n    0 0 10px rgba(var(--gw-neon-rgb),var(--gw-halo-1)),\n    0 0 26px rgba(var(--gw-neon-rgb),var(--gw-halo-2)),\n    0 0 52px rgba(var(--gw-neon-rgb),var(--gw-halo-3));\n}\n\n.gwa-photo{\n  flex:0 0 40%;\n  width:40%;\n  align-self:stretch;\n  min-height:280px;\n  object-fit:cover;\n  object-position:center 12%;\n  display:block;\n  background:var(--gw-photo-bg);\n  border-right:var(--gw-frame-w) solid var(--gw-frame);\n}\n\n.gwa-panel{\n  flex:1;\n  min-width:0;\n  padding:24px 26px;\n  display:flex;flex-direction:column;\n}\n\n.gwa-stars{display:flex;gap:3px;margin-bottom:14px;}\n.gwa-stars svg{\n  width:19px;height:19px;\n  fill:var(--gw-neon);\n  filter:drop-shadow(0 0 4px rgba(var(--gw-neon-rgb),.55));\n}\n\n.gwa-panel h3{\n  margin:0 0 12px;\n  font-family:'Archivo',system-ui,sans-serif;\n  font-weight:900;font-style:italic;text-transform:uppercase;\n  font-size:clamp(17px,1.5vw,22px);\n  line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-0.015em;\n  text-wrap:balance;\n  color:var(--gw-ink);\n}\n.gwa-panel p{\n  margin:0 0 22px;\n  font-family:'Archivo',system-ui,sans-serif;\n  font-weight:600;font-style:normal;\n  font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;\n  color:var(--gw-ink);\n}\n\n.gwa-who{\n  margin-top:auto;\n  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;\n}\n.gwa-av{\n  flex:0 0 auto;\n  width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;\n  object-fit:cover;\n  object-position:center top;\n  background:var(--gw-photo-bg);\n  border:var(--gw-frame-w) solid var(--gw-frame);\n  display:block;\n}\n\n.gwa-who strong{\n  display:block;\n  font-family:'Archivo',system-ui,sans-serif;\n  font-weight:900;font-style:italic;text-transform:uppercase;\n  font-size:16px;letter-spacing:-0.01em;\n  color:var(--gw-ink);\n}\n.gwa-who em{\n  display:block;font-style:normal;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;\n  color:var(--gw-ink);\n}\n\n@media(min-width:1000px){\n  .gwa-grid{\n    grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);\n    grid-auto-rows:1fr;\n    gap:34px;\n  }\n  .gwa-panel{padding:26px 30px;}\n}\n\n@media(min-width:700px) and (max-width:999px){\n  .gwa-grid{\n    grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);\n    grid-auto-rows:1fr;\n    gap:30px;\n  }\n}\n\n/* --- MOBILE : photo entière, jamais rognée --- */\n@media(max-width:699px){\n  .gwa{\n    padding:40px 0 46px;\n    width:100vw;max-width:100vw;\n    margin-left:calc(50% - 50vw);\n    margin-right:calc(50% - 50vw);\n  }\n  .gwa-title{margin:0 20px 26px;}\n\n  .gwa-grid{\n    display:flex;\n    flex-direction:row;\n    gap:18px;\n    max-width:none;\n    padding:6px 16px 10px;\n    overflow-x:auto;\n    overflow-y:hidden;\n    scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;\n    -webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;\n    scrollbar-width:none;\n  }\n  .gwa-grid::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none;}\n\n  .gwa-card{\n    flex:0 0 var(--gw-card-w);\n    scroll-snap-align:center;\n    flex-direction:column;\n    height:auto;\n  }\n\n  /* !important : certains thèmes forcent img{height:auto} en global */\n  .gwa .gwa-photo{\n    flex:0 0 auto !important;\n    width:100% !important;\n    height:auto !important;\n    min-height:0 !important;\n    max-height:none !important;\n    aspect-ratio:var(--gw-photo-ar) !important;\n    object-fit:cover !important;\n    object-position:var(--gw-photo-pos) !important;\n    border-right:none;\n    border-bottom:var(--gw-frame-w) solid var(--gw-frame);\n  }\n\n  .gwa-panel{padding:15px 16px 17px;}\n  .gwa-stars{margin-bottom:9px;}\n  .gwa-stars svg{width:16px;height:16px;}\n  .gwa-panel h3{font-size:17px;line-height:1.12;margin:0 0 8px;}\n  .gwa-panel p{font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.45;margin:0 0 15px;}\n  .gwa-av{width:36px;height:36px;}\n  .gwa-who{gap:10px;}\n  .gwa-who strong{font-size:14px;}\n  .gwa-who em{font-size:12px;}\n}\n</style>",
